  Hypothesis SBR : ltac2:(zQ "a0!hia!ld!s7!sc!hh2!ina!je!ih6!o2!hhb@1$4@2$0@2$1$5?2sb@2$0@2$1@2$8?2sb$7@1$6?5HCEIL@3$2$3@2$9?2sb+hggg0Z").
